<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Family Protection Report™ - CoverScore AI</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #F9FAFB; color: #111827; }
        .card-shadow { box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03); }
        .gradient-bg { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1E3A8A 0%, #3B82F6 100%); }
        .gradient-text { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1E3A8A 0%, #3B82F6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="antialiased">

<main class="max-w-md mx-auto bg-white min-h-screen relative pb-12 shadow-xl">
    
    <!-- 1. Cover Page -->
    <section class="gradient-bg text-white px-6 py-12 rounded-b-3xl">
        <h3 class="text-blue-100 font-medium tracking-wide text-sm mb-2 uppercase">CoverScore Personal™</h3>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Family Protection Report™</h1>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-blue-50">
            <div>
                <p class="opacity-75 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Prepared for</p>
                <p class="font-medium text-lg">{{first_name}}</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p class="opacity-75 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Assessment Date</p>
                <p class="font-medium">{{assessment_date}}</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p class="opacity-75 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Report Reference</p>
                <p class="font-medium font-mono text-xs opacity-75">{{report_id}}</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-blue-400/30">
            <p class="text-sm italic opacity-90">This private report gives you a practical view of your current family-protection readiness and highlights areas you may want to strengthen over time.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="px-5">

        <!-- 2. Welcome -->
        <section class="mt-8 mb-10">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Hello, {{first_name}}.</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">Thank you for completing your Family Protection Score™.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">This report is designed to help you reflect on how prepared your household may be for unexpected changes involving income, health, family responsibilities, and education expenses.</p>
            <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-xl p-4 mt-6 text-sm text-blue-800">
                <p class="font-medium mb-1">What this report covers:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-2 text-blue-700 opacity-90">
                    <li>Your Family Protection Score™</li>
                    <li>Your strongest protection area</li>
                    <li>The areas that deserve the most attention</li>
                    <li>Your Protection Profile™</li>
                    <li>A practical action plan</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. Score Summary -->
        <section class="mb-10 text-center bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100 card-shadow">
            <h2 class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 font-semibold mb-2">Your Score</h2>
            
            <div class="relative inline-flex items-center justify-center w-32 h-32 rounded-full {{bg_color}} mb-4 shadow-inner">
                <span class="text-4xl font-bold {{score_color}}">{{score.overall}}</span>
                <span class="absolute bottom-4 text-xs font-medium opacity-60 {{score_color}}">/100</span>
            </div>

            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 {{score_color}}">{{score.status_label}}</h3>
            
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">
                {{#if is_strong}}
                You have a strong protection foundation. Continue reviewing your plans whenever your income or family responsibilities change.
                {{/if}}
                {{#if is_stable}}
                You have useful protection measures in place. A few targeted improvements could strengthen your household’s readiness further.
                {{/if}}
                {{#if is_moderate}}
                Your result shows important areas that may need attention. Strengthening these areas can improve your household’s ability to manage unexpected pressure.
                {{/if}}
                {{#if is_vulnerable}}
                Your result suggests that your household may face meaningful financial pressure if income, health, or family responsibilities change unexpectedly.
                {{/if}}
                {{#if is_critical}}
                Your result indicates several important protection gaps. A focused review of household income continuity, family protection, health access, and emergency readiness is recommended.
                {{/if}}
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-4 italic">A higher score reflects a larger protection gap. It does not predict an event.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. Strongest Area -->
        {{#if strongest_area}}
        <section class="mb-10">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3 flex items-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
                Your Strongest Area
            </h2>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-200 card-shadow border-l-4 border-l-green-500">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">{{strongest_area}}</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                    {{#if (eq strongest_area "Income Continuity")}}Your current answers suggest that you have a relatively stronger ability to maintain essential household expenses if income changes unexpectedly.{{/if}}
                    {{#if (eq strongest_area "Family Life Protection")}}Your current answers suggest that your family-protection foundation is relatively stronger than your other assessed areas.{{/if}}
                    {{#if (eq strongest_area "Health Protection")}}Your current answers suggest that health access and medical-cost readiness are relatively stronger than your other assessed areas.{{/if}}
                    {{#if (eq strongest_area "Emergency Readiness")}}Your current answers suggest that you have a relatively stronger emergency-savings position than your other assessed areas.{{/if}}
                    {{#if (eq strongest_area "Education Continuity")}}Your current answers suggest that education expenses may be more manageable than your other assessed areas if household income changes.{{/if}}
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>
        {{/if}}

        <!-- 5. Priority Areas -->
        <section class="mb-10">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1">Your Priority Areas</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-5">These are the areas that currently deserve the most attention based on your answers.</p>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                {{#each priority_actions}}
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-200 card-shadow relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-full bg-blue-500"></div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2 py-1 rounded">Priority {{@index}}</span>
                        {{#if (eq priority "Immediate")}}
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-red-600 bg-red-50 px-2 py-1 rounded">Immediate</span>
                        {{else}}
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-orange-600 bg-orange-50 px-2 py-1 rounded">High</span>
                        {{/if}}
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-2">{{title}}</h3>
                    
                    <div class="mt-3 space-y-3">
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Why it matters</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mt-1">
                                {{#if (eq recommendation_id "REC-FAM-001")}}A household that relies heavily on one income source may face pressure when that income is interrupted.{{/if}}
                                {{#if (eq recommendation_id "REC-FAM-002")}}When others depend on you financially, a protection gap can affect everyday household needs and future plans.{{/if}}
                                {{#if (eq recommendation_id "REC-FAM-003")}}Unexpected medical needs can create financial pressure when health cover is limited.{{/if}}
                                {{#if (eq recommendation_id "REC-FAM-004")}}Unexpected expenses are easier to manage when there is a dedicated reserve for essential household needs.{{/if}}
                                {{#if (eq recommendation_id "REC-FAM-005")}}Education expenses can become difficult to sustain when household income changes unexpectedly.{{/if}}
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-100">
                            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Practical Next Step</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-800 font-medium">{{action}}</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                {{/each}}
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 6. Protection Profile (Risk DNA) -->
        {{#if risk_dna.length}}
        <section class="mb-10">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1">Your Protection Profile™</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-5">These patterns highlight practical signals from your answers.</p>

            <div class="grid gap-3">
                {{#each risk_dna}}
                <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-slate-200">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center">
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 7h.01M7 3h5c.512 0 1.024.195 1.414.586l7 7a2 2 0 010 2.828l-7 7a2 2 0 01-2.828 0l-7-7A1.994 1.994 0 013 12V7a4 4 0 014-4z"></path></svg>
                        {{name}}
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-2">{{explanation}}</p>
                </div>
                {{/each}}
            </div>
        </section>
        {{/if}}

        <!-- 7. Why This Matters -->
        {{#if risk_story}}
        <section class="mb-10 bg-indigo-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-indigo-100">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-indigo-900 mb-2">Why This Matters: {{risk_story.title}}</h2>
            <p class="text-indigo-800 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">{{risk_story.summary}}</p>
            <p class="text-indigo-900 text-sm font-medium italic border-t border-indigo-200 pt-3">This is not about expecting the worst. It is about giving your household more options and less pressure when unexpected events occur.</p>
        </section>
        {{/if}}

        <!-- 8. Action Plan -->
        <section class="mb-10">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Your Action Plan</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-6">You do not need to solve everything at once. Start with actions that will make the greatest difference.</p>

            <div class="relative border-l-2 border-blue-200 ml-3 space-y-8">
                
                <div class="relative pl-6">
                    <div class="absolute w-4 h-4 bg-blue-500 rounded-full -left-[9px] top-1 shadow"></div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">This Week</h3>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700">
                        <li>Identify your essential monthly household expenses.</li>
                        <li>Review how long your current savings could support those expenses.</li>
                        <li>Write down the people and responsibilities that depend most on your income.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="relative pl-6">
                    <div class="absolute w-4 h-4 bg-white border-2 border-blue-500 rounded-full -left-[9px] top-1 shadow"></div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900">This Month</h3>
                    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700">
                        <li>Create a simple continuity plan for the priority areas highlighted above.</li>
                        <li>Review existing protection plans to ensure they cover your actual needs.</li>
                        <li>Set a realistic monthly savings target for emergency reserves.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 9. Recommended Learning -->
        {{#if academy_recommendation}}
        <section class="mb-10 bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-200 card-shadow flex items-start space-x-4">
            <div class="bg-blue-100 p-3 rounded-lg text-blue-600">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Recommended Lesson</h3>
                <p class="font-bold text-gray-900">{{academy_recommendation.course_name}}</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">{{academy_recommendation.reason}}</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        {{/if}}

        <!-- 10. Optional Advisor Support -->
        <section class="mb-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-gray-800 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center card-shadow">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Want to discuss your result?</h2>
            
            {{#if advisor_opportunity.eligible}}
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">A CoverScore Risk Advisor can help you understand your report and explore suitable protection options. No obligation.</p>
                <a href="https://wa.me/2349165304629?text=I%20would%20like%20Advisor%20Support%20for%20my%20Report%20{{report_id}}" 
                   class="inline-block w-full bg-white text-gray-900 font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors">
                   Talk to an Advisor
                </a>
            {{else}}
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mb-0 leading-relaxed">You have requested advisor support. A Risk Advisor will contact you shortly.</p>
            {{/if}}
        </section>

    </div>

    <!-- 11. Disclaimer & Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-gray-100 border-t border-gray-200 px-6 py-8 rounded-t-3xl mt-auto">
        <div class="mb-6">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Important Notes</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">This report is educational and is based on the answers provided during your CoverScore Family Protection Score™ assessment. It is not a policy quotation, insurance contract, medical opinion, legal advice, investment advice, financial plan, or guarantee of policy approval, claim payment, health outcome, or financial result.</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mt-2">Insurance products, benefits, exclusions, eligibility requirements, premiums, and policy terms vary by provider and individual circumstances.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-center pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-800">CoverScore Personal™</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Smart Risk. Stronger Decisions.</p>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-4 uppercase tracking-widest">Private & Confidential</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

</main>

</body>
</html>
